<title>UK: South West appoints as Harvey chairman.</title>
<headline>South West appoints as Harvey chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South West Water Plc said on Thursday it had appointed Kenneth Harvey as chairman of the firm from March, 1997.</p>
<p>Harvey, 56, would succeed Keith Court who retires at the end of February.</p>
